        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: Taken for Granted, Party Like a Russian\n- People: Sia, Nigel Corsbie, Sergei Prokofiev\n- Works: Montagues and Capulets\n- Topics: songwriting, production, sampling\n\nFacts:\n- Sergei Prokofiev wrote the classical music work \"Montagues and Capulets\".\n- Sia wrote the song \"Taken for Granted\".\n- Nigel Corsbie produced the song \"Taken for Granted\".\n- The song \"Taken for Granted\" heavily samples Sergei Prokofiev's \"Montagues and Capulets\".\n- The chorus of the song \"Party Like a Russian\" samples Sergei Prokofiev's \"Montagues and Capulets\".",
